{"type":"text","timestamp":1787395587261,"sessionID":"ses_fd6ecf8e7ffeQIAY4RnDqG5Oe6","part":{"id":"prt_0291437f5001wdIHGx0i2Dh3Hr","messageID":"msg_0291433c60019Vz3o22VMVwYum","sessionID":"ses_fd6ecf8e7ffeQIAY4RnDqG5Oe6","type":"text","text":"Uh oh - c05 (Decide) is reporting unreachable_arm but should be empty (exhaustive and well-formed). And c06 (Partial) should report switch_inexhaustive. Let me debug these:","time":{"start":1787395586037,"end":1787395587254}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1787395587371,"sessionID":"ses_fd6ecf8e7ffeQIAY4RnDqG5Oe6","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_01GttG6cWDbcPLX2eFZ95EaA","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cat /private/tmp/bsharp-audition/copilot-haiku45/cases/c05-tuple-exhaustive/Decide/in.bs"},"output":"module Decide\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent, bool redelivered)\nRoute(o, p, r) -> (o, p, r) switch {\n    (true,  _,     _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true,  _)     => :dead_letter,\n    (false, false, false) => :requeue,\n    (false, false, true)  => :requeue\n}\n","metadata":{"output":"module Decide\npublic atom Route(bool ok, bool permanent, bool redelivered)\nRoute(o, p, r) -> (o, p, r) switch {\n    (true,  _,     _)     => :ack,\n    (false, true,  _)     => :dead_letter,\n    (false, false, false) => :requeue,\n    (false, false, true)  => :requeue\n}\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cat /private/tmp/bsharp-audition/copilot-haiku45/cases/c05-tuple-exhaustive/Decide/in.bs","time":{"start":1787395587352,"end":1787395587355}},"metadata":{"anthropic":{"caller":{"type":"direct"}}},"id":"prt_029143cba001dfWKB1luEJxD84","sessionID":"ses_fd6ecf8e7ffeQIAY4RnDqG5Oe6","messageID":"msg_0291433c60019Vz3o22VMVwYum"}}
